[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="EnemySkill" load_steps=3 format=3]

; Accelerator basic attack — short burst of 3 energy bolts in a tight spread.
; Approximates the player's channeled beam as a rapid-fire cone spray. Close
; to mid-range; the spread makes it deadly up close but inaccurate at distance.
; Energy weapon visual (glowing bolts, not bullets).

